   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "text": "RUNNINGHUB — START HERE\n\n1. Import this workflow JSON into RunningHub.\n\n2. Upload and select your reference files in the labeled\nnodes:\nCharacter 1 (#80)\nCharacter 2 (#81)\n\n3. Click Run. When rendering finishes, download the\nsaved video.\n\nThe story, prompts and connections are already set up.\nYou do not need to reconnect nodes or change model\nsettings for the first run.\n\nOPTIONAL CHANGES\nTo change steps: edit steps in BasicScheduler (#22).\nFor another full render: enter a new project name in\nMultiTrack Project (#38).\n\nIF A RUN FAILS\nIf RunningHub reports a missing model or node, send\nCodex the exact error and your exported workflow JSON.\nCodex can adapt the file to your RunningHub setup.",
    "fontSize": 52,
    "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
    "backgroundColor": "#20152E",
    "backgroundAlpha": 0.94,
    "borderRadius": 18,
