   },
   "order": 21,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "text": "KEEP USING YOUR OWN SETUP\n\nWhen you have a workflow that works, save or export its\neditable workflow JSON.\n\nFor your next story, attach that JSON to Codex and say:\n\nUse this workflow as my template. Keep my model choices,\nreference loaders, generation settings and video-saving\nconnections. Make a new workflow for this story:\n[describe your story].\n\nSay whether you will render in RunningHub or local\nComfyUI. RunningHub is the default.\n\nChanged your workflow settings?\nExport it again and attach the new JSON next time, so\nCodex uses your latest setup.\n\nWant that template used by default without attaching it\neach time?\nAsk Codex to update your installed BDM Easy Media\nWorkflows skill with that JSON.",
    "fontSize": 52,
    "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
    "backgroundColor": "#20152E",
    "backgroundAlpha": 0.94,
    "borderRadius": 18,
    "padding": 36,
